{"slug":"sneaker-releases-november-1-7-2026","title":"Sneaker releases next week: November 1 to 7, 2026","category":"Release Dates","date":"2026-10-30","publish":"2026-10-30T11:30:00+00:00",
"description":"Kobe 3 Low Black, Pharrell's Adistar Jellyfish, a Foamposite college pack, Union's Bamboo Dunk and the Air Jordan 6 White Infrared lead November 1 to 7.",
"image":BOX,"image_alt":BOXALT,
"body":f"""<p><strong>The short answer:</strong> the first week of November brings a release almost every day, led by the Air Jordan 6 "White Infrared" on Saturday, November 7, according to the <a href="{SIN}">SoleInsider November calendar</a> and Nike's own <a href="{UPC}">SNKRS upcoming list</a>.</p>
<h2>Sunday, November 1</h2>
<p>SoleInsider lists the Nike Kobe 3 Low Protro "Black" (IV7127&#8209;002) at $190 and the Pharrell x adidas Adistar "Jellyfish" (KH6727) at $300, both at 10 AM ET. <a href="{SFR}">Sneaker Freaker's calendar</a> adds New Balance 991v2 "Elevated Neutrals" pairs for the same day.</p>
<h2>Tuesday to Thursday</h2>
<p>The Air Foamposite Pro "Mummy Duck" is listed for November 3. SoleInsider now shows it at $240 under style code JA5895&#8209;001, while Sneaker Freaker lists style code IZ7806&#8209;001 for that date, so check the code on the retailer page. On November 5, SoleInsider lists the Foamposite Pro "FSU," "LSU" and "Ohio State" at $250 each and the Victor Wembanyama x Nike GT Cut 4 "State of Liberty" at $210. Nike's SNKRS pages list the <a href="/news/nike-air-max-foamdome-eggplant-jordan-11-mcs-space-jam-november-5-2026/">Air Max Foamdome "Eggplant" at $265 and the Jordan 11 MCS "Space Jam" cleat at $225</a> the same day.</p>
<h2>Friday, November 6</h2>
<p>SoleInsider lists the New Balance 990v7 Made in USA (U990GR7) at $200, the Union x Nike Dunk Low "Bamboo" at $130 and the Nike SB Dunk Low "Champagne" (IQ0431&#8209;300) at $130. Nike's SNKRS page lists the <a href="/news/one-block-down-nike-air-max-95-big-bubble-lux-november-6-2026/">One Block Down Air Max 95 Big Bubble Lux</a> at $200.</p>
<h2>Saturday, November 7</h2>
<p>The <a href="/news/air-jordan-6-white-infrared-november-7-2026/">Air Jordan 6 "White Infrared"</a> arrives at $215, and SoleInsider lists the Nike Book 2 "Chromaflair" (FZ7013&#8209;003) at $145, noting its date moved from November 8. Sneaker Freaker's calendar also lists the Air Jordan 15, an Air Jordan 17 Low and two Bad Bunny x adidas BadBo pairs for November 7.</p>
<p>US clocks go back one hour on November 1, so a 10 AM ET launch lands one hour later in UTC than it did in October. Every pair with a confirmed price is in our <a href="/releases/">release calendar</a>. Dates often move, so confirm on the retailer page before release day.</p>""",
"sources":[("November 2026 Sneaker Release Dates",SIN,"SoleInsider","2026-10-30"),("Upcoming launches",UPC,"Nike SNKRS","2026-10-30"),("Sneaker Release Calendar",SFR,"Sneaker Freaker","2026-10-30")]},
